Sval: Remove the password manager's form filling

Firefox's password manager is locked off (Sval spec §7.3), so its
per-page actor bailed on every event it was created for. The
LoginManager actor goes with what only it used: login autocomplete
and its popup rows, password generation and its rules, site recipes
and related realms, passkey rows in the login dropdown, the content
context menu's password items and Relay mask item, the remote
settings dumps those read, the login autocomplete search's component
registration, strings and tests. HTTP authentication prompts and the
login storage stay.

